br><p><a href=\"http://b/579867878\"><span>579867878</span></a><span> </span><span>High</span><span> CVE-2026-131023 Race condition in Core</span></p><br><p><a href=\"http://b/580869107\"><span>580869107</span></a><span> </span><span>High</span><span> CVE-2026-126921 Use after free in Accessibility</span></p><br><p><a href=\"http://b/581629247\"><span>581629247</span></a><span> </span><span>High</span><span> CVE-2026-126890 Out of bounds read in Media</span></p><br><p><a href=\"http://b/567611696\"><span>567611696</span></a><span> </span><span>High</span><span> CVE-2026-126886 Use after free in Frames</span></p><br><p><a href=\"http://b/580846651\"><span>580846651</span></a><span> </span><span>High</span><span> CVE-2026-126852 Use after free in MediaStream</span></p><br><p><a href=\"http://b/578656065\"><span>578656065</span></a><span> </span><span>High</span><span> CVE-2026-126892 Use after free in MediaStream</span></p><br><p><a href=\"http://b/572578603\"><span>572578603</span></a><span> </span><span>High</span><span> CVE-2026-125350 Use after free in XML</span></p><br><p><a href=\"http://b/578664961\"><span>578664961</span></a><span> </span><span>High</span><span> CVE-2026-126840 Out of bounds write in Network</span></p><br><p><a href=\"http://b/578655807\"><span>578655807</span></a><span> </span><span>High</span><span> CVE-2026-126854 Incorrect authorization in Layout</span></p><br><p><a href=\"http://b/581064654\"><span>581064654</span></a><span> </span><span>High</span><span> CVE-2026-131101 Out of bounds read in Editing</span></p><br><p><a href=\"http://b/574792758\"><span>574792758</span></a><span> </span><span>High</span><span> CVE-2026-126851 Use after free in Accessibility</span></p><br><p><a href=\"http://b/582218292\"><span>582218292</span></a><span> </span><span>High</span><span> CVE-2026-130952 Uninitialized resource in Network</span></p><br><p><a href=\"http://b/580875215\"><span>580875215</span></a><span> </span><span>High</span><span> CVE-2026-126913 Out of bounds read in Compositing</span></p><br><p><a href=\"http://b/523554372\"><span>523554372</span></a><span> </span><span>High</span><span> CVE-2026-91731 Type confusion in Compositing</span></p><br><p><a href=\"http://b/553136980\"><span>553136980</span></a><span> </span><span>Medium</span><span> CVE-2026-93385 Information leak in Paint</span></p><br><p><a href=\"http://b/559793873\"><span>559793873</span></a><span> </span><span>High</span><span> CVE-2026-106393 Use after free in Storage</span></p><br><p><a href=\"http://b/565681451\"><span>565681451</span></a><span> </span><span>Medium</span><span> CVE-2026-121184 Out of bounds read in Media</span></p><br><p><a href=\"http://b/568699166\"><span>568699166</span></a><span> </span><span>Critical</span><span> CVE-2026-126885 Use after free in ServiceWorker</span></p><br><p><a href=\"http://b/580921803\"><span>580921803</span></a><span> </span><span>High</span><span> CVE-2026-126911 Use after free in Accessibility</span></p><br><p><a href=\"http://b/572269631\"><span>572269631</span></a><span> </span><span>High</span><span> CVE-2026-76030 Incorrect authorization in FileSystem</span></p><br><p><a href=\"http://b/569012015\"><span>569012015</span></a><span> </span><span>High</span><span> CVE-2026-76028 Incorrect authorization in FileSystem</span></p><br><p><a href=\"http://b/575524700\"><span>575524700</span></a><span> </span><span>Critical</span><span> CVE-2026-126895 Use after free in CSS</span></p><p><span>Release notes for LTS-150 can be found</span><a href=\"https://support.google.com/chrome/a/answer/12239814\"><span> </span><span>here</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>Want to know more about Long-term Support? Click</span><a href=\"https://support.google.com/chrome/a/answer/11333726\"><span> </span><span>here</span></a></p><p><span>Andy Wu</span></p><p><span>Google Chrome OS</span></p></span></p>","zhKind","complete","补丁","版本更新","Google","http://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2026/11/long-term-supp